: Provenance: CAPTURED from the Gemini Developer API, streamed, model
: gemini-3.8-flash, on 2026-11-20, under SMA-827 (PR #373). This is capture 1
: of that probe: one turn that asks for three parallel calls. The exact URL is
: not recorded. Sven ran the probe. The SMA-827 design records the results.
:
: Removed: not recorded. The SMA-827 design says the stream has four SSE
: chunks (probe results, capture 1). This file has four chunks. So the record
: shows that no whole chunk is missing. It does not show what each chunk lost.
: Added: not recorded.
: Changed: the real 1140-character thoughtSignature is replaced with SIG_A.
: The SMA-827 design (line 290) says each real signature is replaced by a
: placeholder. The key "thoughtSignature":"SIG_A" has no space after its colon.
: Every other key in the file has a space after its colon. The record does not
: say why. The same edit may have reformatted this key.
:
: One sign is unexplained. The value candidatesTokenCount rises in equal steps
: (14, 28, 42) and the last chunk repeats 42. The record does not say whether
: the wire sent these values or an edit made them. Do not read them as proof of
: wire behaviour.
:
: The file ends after the fourth chunk. It has no [DONE] line. The record does
: not say whether the wire sent one.
:
: This is not the capture in the Live capture section of
: tests/provider-stream-conformance/tests/conformance.rs. That capture used
: gemini-3.6-flash on 2026-08-20. Do not cite one capture as the source of the
: other.

